{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261127/photo/bkn-20261127111514871-1127_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261127163001\"/><p>4名被捕人士。</p><p>元朗區警員前日(25日)在天水圍天耀邨一帶展開打擊非法街頭賭博行動。行動中，警員共拘捕4人，涉嫌「在賭場以外任何場所或在街道上進行賭博」，並檢獲相關賭具和現金等證物。該部門呼籲市民切勿參與街頭聚賭，以身試法。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T09:04:04.611798+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T03:15:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T12:37:17.638524+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T08:57:19.314275+00:00","content_hash":"ed5d04e9403836c060991fcbd479c2754fceaf13e4605f060a2509a7fbc27b8f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T09:04:04.611798+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}